            "body": "## Code Review\n\nThis pull request addresses a bug in `get_ppo_ray_runtime_env` that caused the `working_dir` in Ray's runtime environment to be handled incorrectly. The changes ensure that an existing `working_dir` from the job configuration is respected and passed through, and that the key is omitted if not present, which fixes the issue of it being clobbered. The JSON parsing is also made more robust. I've added one comment to further improve the exception handling by making it more specific.",
